Z||000001||fierosound||01-25-2000||11:19 PM||||It'll look cool - but the light will make it harder to see out in the dark when you're driving because our eyes will adjust to the light INSIDE the car.  That's why you don't drive with the dome lights on.  Also, you'd probably get all kinds of reflections on your windshield, sideglass, and rear view mirror.  Personally, I'd not do it.||||reg||10
