Z||000006||SloPonti||01-26-2000||12:05 AM||||i have neon tubes! i have two four foot tubes on each side of the car and three foot tubes on the fron and back! also i have neons under the dash-not visible but give the interior a nice glow! i drive with them on all the time at night! everyone that rides with me likes them because you can see very well inside and it does not affect night time vision! also i have a neon tube in the engine compartment for show! when pop the trunk the neon light comes on to show off my new motor! when i get the car up and running i will post pictures of everything! in my opinion this setup looks great and i only turn them on for shows or in parking lots! never on the streets-cops don't like it! thanks<BR>Rob||||reg||1
